  </data>
  <data name="SourceSound_ChannelMap" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>声道分配</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SourceSound_ChannelMap_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将源声道分配给此片段。JSON: {"Format":"Stereo","Sources":[2,3],"SourceLayout":{"ChannelCount":4,"Speakers":51}}。Format：Auto、Mono、Stereo、Surround51 或 Surround71。Sources 为每个片段声道指定从 0 开始的源声道索引，-1 表示静音。SourceLayout 记录源声道数和数字扬声器掩码（无位置信息时为 0）。源布局变化后使用 Auto。Auto: {"Format":"Auto","Sources":[]}。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ChannelMap_Format" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>格式</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ChannelMap_Auto" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>自动</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ChannelMap_Surround51" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>5.1ch</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ChannelMap_Surround71" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>7.1ch</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ChannelMap_None" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>无</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Panner_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>声像调节</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Panner_Help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>拖动圆点调整声像。双击重置。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PitchShiftEffect" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>变调</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PitchShiftEffect_Semitones" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>半音</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingEffect" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>重采样</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingEffect_Method" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>方式</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingEffect_Method_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将音频转换为项目采样率时填补采样点之间空隙的方式。保持最粗糙，线性次之，Catmull–Rom 和 4 点 Lagrange 更平滑。Sinc 16 和 Sinc 64 还会去除转换产生或折叠的多余频率，结果最干净。此效果之前的效果以源采样率处理，之后的效果以项目采样率处理。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_Hold" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>保持</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_Linear" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>线性</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_CatmullRom" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Catmull–Rom</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_Lagrange" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>4 点 Lagrange</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_Sinc16" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sinc 16</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingMethod_Sinc64" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sinc 64</value>
  </data>
  <data name="VibratoEffect" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>颤音</value>
  </data>
  <data name="VibratoEffect_Rate" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>速率 (Hz)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="VibratoEffect_Depth" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>深度 (ms)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RingModulatorEffect" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>环形调制器</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RingModulatorEffect_Frequency" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>频率 (Hz)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RingModulatorEffect_Mix" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>混合 (%)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SourceSound_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>播放媒体文件中的音频（音频剪辑、声音素材 / audio clip, sound source）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SceneSound_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>播放另一个场景的混音（嵌套音频、预合成音频 / nested audio, precomp audio）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SoundGroup_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将多段声音混合起来以便统一调整（音频总线、子混音、音频组 / audio bus, submix, audio group）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="DelayEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>经过可调的延迟后重复播放声音（回声、音频延迟 / echo, audio delay）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="EqualizerEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>提升或降低各个频段的电平（EQ、图形均衡器、音色控制 / EQ, graphic equalizer, tone control）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CompressorEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>降低响亮声音的电平以缩小动态范围（动态范围压缩、音频压缩器 / dynamic range compression, audio compressor）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="LimiterEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将音频峰值限制在设定电平以内（峰值限制器、硬限幅器 / peak limiter, brickwall limiter）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GateEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>衰减低于设定电平的声音（噪声门、扩展器 / noise gate, expander）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TimeStretchEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>在保持音高的同时改变音频播放速度（时间伸缩、变速、保持音高 / time stretch, speed change, preserve pitch）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="NoiseReductionEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>减轻嘶嘶声或嗡嗡声等持续的背景噪声（降噪、去除噪声 / denoise, noise removal）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PitchShiftEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>按半音升高或降低音频的音高（变调器、移调 / pitch shifter, transpose）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ResamplingEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将音频转换为项目的采样率（采样率转换、重采样 / sample rate conversion, SRC）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="VibratoEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>周期性地升降音频的音高（音高调制、音高颤动 / pitch modulation, pitch wobble）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="RingModulatorEffect_LibraryDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>将音频与单频信号相乘以产生金属质感（环形调制、金属音 / ring modulation, metallic voice）。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AudioEffectCategory_EqAndCleanup" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>均衡与降噪</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AudioEffectCategory_Dynamics" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>动态处理</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AudioEffectCategory_TimeAndPitch" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>时间与音高</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AudioEffectCategory_DelayAndModulation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>延迟与调制</value>
  </data>
